# Environment secrets -- ignore every variant, but keep the tracked templates.
# client/.env.production is tracked on purpose: it holds only the public
# production API base URL (no secrets) so production builds succeed without a
# host dashboard variable. Real environment variables still override it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
!client/.env.production
